===Etymology===
Related to {{och-l|唯|id=1|to be}}. Its usual meaning "kind, compliant" could be semantically extended from "should be" > "to consider / treat as it should / ought to be, as expected" as copulas tend to expand into full verb ({{zh-ref|Schuessler, 2007}}).

For pronunciation 2, compare the development of the pronunciation of {{zh-l|畦}} from {{ltc-l|畦}}, which historically differed with {{ltc-l|惠}} only in tone, and is homophonous with {{zh-l|惠|tr=-}} ({{IPAfont|/ɕi⁵⁵/}}) in the modern Xi'an dialect ({{zh-ref|Xi, 2017}}).

