===Definitions===
{{head|zh|hanzi}}

# to [[think]] {{gl|to conceive of something or someone}}
#: {{zh-x|你 想 多 了 吧！|You've over'''thought''' this!; You've '''read too much''' into this!}}
#: {{zh-x|我 想 她 是 衰老 了。|I '''think''' she's going senile.}}
# to [[think]] about; to [[plan]]; to be [[considering]]
#: {{zh-x|我 想 在 暑假{jià} 打工。|I'm '''planning''' to get a job for the summer.}}
# to [[think]]; to [[suppose]]; to [[guess]]; to [[reckon]]
#: {{zh-x|我 想 我 能 給 你 找 到 合適 的 尺碼。|I '''think''' I can find the right size for you.}}
# to [[want]]; to [[wish]] for; to [[desire]]
#: {{zh-x|還 想 喝 一 杯 嗎？|Would you '''like''' another drink?}}
#: {{zh-x|她 想 當 芭蕾舞 演員。|She '''wants''' to be a ballet dancer.}}
#: {{zh-x|我 很 想 睡。|I'm really sleepy.|lit=I really '''want''' to sleep.}}
#: {{zh-x|睇 到 唔 想 睇|watched so much that one doesn't want to watch any more|C}}
# to [[miss]] {{gl|to feel the absence of someone or something}}
#: {{zh-x|你 走 了 我 會 想 你 的。|I'll '''miss''' you when you're gone.}}
# to [[resemble]]
#: {{zh-x|雲 '''想''' 衣裳 花 '''想''' 容|Clouds '''look like''' her clothes, flowers '''look like''' her face.|CL|ref={{lang|zh|李白《清平調》}}}}
# {{lb|zh|Hinduism|Buddhism}} [[sanskara]]

====Usage notes====
* In the sense of want or desire, {{zh-l|想}} is also used as [[would like]]. It also appears together with {{zh-l|要|'''yào'''}} as {{zh-l|想要}} to mean "would like".

